//! Port of `PhotoReview.Shell.Interop/Graphics/RenderingAdditions.cs` (94 lines, WP-15) and `DWriteAdditions.cs` (64 lines, WP-17),
//! baseline `d92d6aae`. Unit W8-11f.
//!
//! What the two C# files were: raw-vtable calls for the two methods the WP-13b declarations had left as `Reserved` placeholders
//! (`ID2D1RenderTarget::FillRoundedRectangle` slot 19, `IDWriteFactory::CreateEllipsisTrimmingSign` slot 20), the
//! `D2dRoundedRect` struct and a `GraphicsKernel32` class (`CloseHandle`, `WaitForSingleObjectEx`, high-resolution waitable timer).
//! In Rust the first two are generated by `windows-rs` (`D2D1_ROUNDED_RECT`, `FillRoundedRectangle`, `CreateEllipsisTrimmingSign`);
//! what is kept is the kernel32 part as RAII (`WaitableTimer`, `wait_for_handle`) and the two-step ellipsis trimming recipe.

